14	    13	// point of the script is that a fresh adoption needs nothing but this invocation —
15	    14	// a hermetic mini-canon would prove the plumbing while missing exactly the
16	    15	// cross-module wiring (vendor set → converge-wiring → sweeps) the script exists
17	    16	// to sequence. It lives in engine-tests/ with the canon's other top-level-folder
18	    17	// tests: ci.yml's test roots don't cover the repo root, where bootstrap.mjs sits
