229	  // The hazard behind "an install runs no migrations", stated as a test because the
230	  // skills document it and documentation of a silent behaviour rots invisibly.
231	  //
232	  // `applyVendor` stamps every DECLARED pack at the version this canon ships,
233	  // unconditionally — it converges the mount, it does not run records. At version
234	  // zero that is exactly right: there is no older state, so nothing is skipped, and
